# Component styling

Section files stay `Hero`, `Experience`, `Skills`, `Projects`, `Contact`, `Header`, and `Footer`. Add a file only when a pattern is used twice.

## Primitives

Visual variants go on `cva` in `src/components/ui`. A `className` on `Button` or `Card` is layout only (`w-full`, `gap`).

```tsx
// Bad — a second button style on the call site
<Button variant="premium" className="h-16 rounded-full bg-primary/5 backdrop-blur-md">

// Good — layout at the call site, look on the variant
<Button variant="default" className="w-full sm:w-auto">
```

## Structure

- No decorative wrappers: absolute blurs, gradient overlays, or mask divs.
- Styling does not add `"use client"`.
- Use logical utilities so Arabic mirrors: `ms`, `me`, `ps`, `pe`, `start`, `end`, `text-start`.

## Out of scope while restyling

Do not edit `messages/`, `src/lib/catalog.ts`, `src/lib/site.ts`, metadata, or JSON-LD.
